  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Place couscous, currants and stock concentrate in a large heatproof bowl.\n• Add the boiling water(see ingredients) and stir to combine. Immediately cover with a plate and leave for 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with a fork and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709791a5a49c635d8a8791/step-9a6e1700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Roughly chop cucumber and roasted almonds.\n• Pick rosemary leaves.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709791a5a49c635d8a8791/step-aefea910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add rosemary, the honey a generous squeeze of lemon juice and a splash of water, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709791a5a49c635d8a8791/step-27eaa520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Just before serving, to the bowl with couscous, add tomatoes, cucumber, spinach & rocket mix, green dressing and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Divide cherry tomato couscous between bowls. Top with honey haloumi.\n• Sprinkle with roasted almonds. Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709791a5a49c635d8a8791/step-a3ca6b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
